SUMMARY:(HAMILTON) ROCKCLIFF SIDE TRAIL HIKE 👣
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nCome join us for a fun hike along the Rock
 cliff side trail in Hamilton.\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\nDistance: 7km\nLevel: 
 intermediate (some hills)\nPace: Relaxed/leisure\nFree parking (small lot)
  at the Rockcliff trails parking lot. Street parking is also available.
